## Article 166. Applications, motions, objections

```catala
declaration scope Article166ProceduralApplications:
  input application content WrittenStatement
  input specifiesApplicant content YesNo
  input specifiesRelief content YesNo
  input specifiesGrounds content YesNo
  input filedWithinDeadline content YesNo
  output applicationMeetsRequirements content YesNo

scope Article166ProceduralApplications:
  label application_default definition applicationMeetsRequirements equals No

  label application_complete exception application_default
  definition applicationMeetsRequirements under condition
    application.statementType = WrittenStatementType.ApplicationMotion
    and specifiesApplicant = Yes
    and specifiesRelief = Yes
    and specifiesGrounds = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 167. Formal requirements for written applications/motions/objections

```catala
declaration scope Article167FormalRequirements:
  input statement content WrittenStatement
  input specifiesCourt content YesNo
  input specifiesFiler content YesNo
  input specifiesFilerAddress content YesNo
  input specifiesRelief content YesNo
  input specifiesGrounds content YesNo
  input signedByFiler content YesNo
  input specifiesDate content YesNo
  output meetsFormalRequirements content YesNo

scope Article167FormalRequirements:
  label formal_default definition meetsFormalRequirements equals No

  label formal_complete exception formal_default
  definition meetsFormalRequirements under condition
    specifiesCourt = Yes
    and specifiesFiler = Yes
    and specifiesFilerAddress = Yes
    and specifiesRelief = Yes
    and specifiesGrounds = Yes
    and signedByFiler = Yes
    and specifiesDate = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 168. Filing a claim

```catala
declaration scope Article168FilingClaim:
  input review content ClaimReview
  input claimFiled content YesNo
  output claimCanBeFiled content YesNo

scope Article168FilingClaim:
  label filing_default definition claimCanBeFiled equals No

  label filing_available exception filing_default
  definition claimCanBeFiled under condition
    claimFiled = Yes
    and review.statement.statementType = WrittenStatementType.StatementOfClaim
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 169. Leaving claim without motion, returning claim

```catala
declaration scope Article169ClaimReturn:
  input review content ClaimReview
  output claimReviewResult content ClaimReviewResult
  output returnGround content ClaimReturnGround

scope Article169ClaimReturn:
  label review_default definition claimReviewResult equals ClaimReviewResult.ClaimAccepted

# No court fee paid
  label return_no_fee exception review_default
  definition claimReviewResult under condition
    review.courtFeePaid = No
    consequence equals ClaimReviewResult.ClaimReturned

  label ground_no_fee definition returnGround under condition
    review.courtFeePaid = No
    consequence equals ClaimReturnGround.NoCourtFeePaid

# No defendant identification
  label return_no_defendant exception review_default
  definition claimReviewResult under condition
    review.defendantIdentified = No
    consequence equals ClaimReviewResult.ClaimReturned

  label ground_no_defendant definition returnGround under condition
    review.defendantIdentified = No
    consequence equals ClaimReturnGround.NoDefendantIdentification

# Not compliant with form
  label return_not_compliant exception review_default
  definition claimReviewResult under condition
    review.formCompliant = No
    consequence equals ClaimReviewResult.ClaimReturned

  label ground_not_compliant definition returnGround under condition
    review.formCompliant = No
    consequence equals ClaimReturnGround.NotCompliantWithForm

# Signed by incapable person
  label return_incapable exception review_default
  definition claimReviewResult under condition
    review.signedByCapablePerson = No
    consequence equals ClaimReviewResult.ClaimReturned

  label ground_incapable definition returnGround under condition
    review.signedByCapablePerson = No
    consequence equals ClaimReturnGround.SignedByIncapablePerson

# Filed by unauthorized person
  label return_unauthorized exception review_default
  definition claimReviewResult under condition
    review.filedByAuthorizedPerson = No
    consequence equals ClaimReviewResult.ClaimReturned

  label ground_unauthorized definition returnGround under condition
    review.filedByAuthorizedPerson = No
    consequence equals ClaimReturnGround.FiledByUnauthorizedPerson

# No power of attorney
  label return_no_poap exception review_default
  definition claimReviewResult under condition
    review.powerOfAttorneyAttached = No
    consequence equals ClaimReviewResult.ClaimReturned

  label ground_no_poap definition returnGround under condition
    review.powerOfAttorneyAttached = No
    consequence equals ClaimReturnGround.NoPowerOfAttorney

# No copies for defendants
  label return_no_copies exception review_default
  definition claimReviewResult under condition
    review.copiesForAllDefendants = No
    consequence equals ClaimReviewResult.ClaimReturned

  label ground_no_copies definition returnGround under condition
    review.copiesForAllDefendants = No
    consequence equals ClaimReturnGround.NoCopiesForDefendants

# Duplicate claim pending
  label return_duplicate exception review_default
  definition claimReviewResult under condition
    review.duplicateClaimPending = Yes
    consequence equals ClaimReviewResult.ClaimReturned

  label ground_duplicate definition returnGround under condition
    review.duplicateClaimPending = Yes
    consequence equals ClaimReturnGround.DuplicateClaimPending

# Claim not signed
  label return_not_signed exception review_default
  definition claimReviewResult under condition
    review.statementSigned = No
    consequence equals ClaimReviewResult.ClaimReturned

  label ground_not_signed definition returnGround under condition
    review.statementSigned = No
    consequence equals ClaimReturnGround.ClaimNotSigned

# Left without motion when deficiencies can be corrected
  label left_without_motion exception review_default
  definition claimReviewResult under condition
    review.formCompliant = No
    consequence equals ClaimReviewResult.ClaimLeftWithoutMotion
```

## Article 170. Refusal to open proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article170RefusalToOpen:
  input review content ClaimReview
  input disputeIsPublicLaw content YesNo
  input preTrialProcedureFollowed content YesNo
  input filingDeadlineRestored content YesNo
  input samePartiesSameSubjectDecided content YesNo
  output proceedingOpened content YesNo
  output refusalGround content RefusalToOpenGround

scope Article170RefusalToOpen:
  label open_default definition proceedingOpened equals Yes

# Not a public law dispute
  label refuse_not_public exception open_default
  definition proceedingOpened under condition
    disputeIsPublicLaw = No
    consequence equals No

  label ground_not_public definition refusalGround under condition
    disputeIsPublicLaw = No
    consequence equals RefusalToOpenGround.DisputeNotPublicLaw

# Pre-trial procedure not followed
  label refuse_pretrial exception open_default
  definition proceedingOpened under condition
    preTrialProcedureFollowed = No
    consequence equals No

  label ground_pretrial definition refusalGround under condition
    preTrialProcedureFollowed = No
    consequence equals RefusalToOpenGround.PreTrialProcedureNotFollowed

# Deadline expired without restoration
  label refuse_deadline exception open_default
  definition proceedingOpened under condition
    review.case.preTrialStatus = PreTrialStatus.NoAttempt
    and filingDeadlineRestored = No
    consequence equals No

  label ground_deadline definition refusalGround under condition
    filingDeadlineRestored = No
    consequence equals RefusalToOpenGround.DeadlineExpiredWithoutRestoration

# Same parties, same subject already decided
  label refuse_res_judicata exception open_default
  definition proceedingOpened under condition
    samePartiesSameSubjectDecided = Yes
    consequence equals No

  label ground_res_judicata definition refusalGround under condition
    samePartiesSameSubjectDecided = Yes
    consequence equals RefusalToOpenGround.SamePartiesSameSubjectAlreadyDecided
```

## Article 171. Opening proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article171OpeningProceedings:
  input review content ClaimReview
  input disputeIsPublicLaw content YesNo
  input preTrialProcedureFollowed content YesNo
  input filingDeadlineRestored content YesNo
  output proceedingsOpened content YesNo

scope Article171OpeningProceedings:
  label opening_default definition proceedingsOpened equals No

  label opening_granted exception opening_default
  definition proceedingsOpened under condition
    review.statement.statementType = WrittenStatementType.StatementOfClaim
    and review.formCompliant = Yes
    and disputeIsPublicLaw = Yes
    and preTrialProcedureFollowed = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 172. Joinder and separation of claims

```catala
declaration scope Article172JoinderSeparation:
  input claimsRelated content YesNo
  input separateConsiderationMoreAppropriate content YesNo
  output canJoinClaims content YesNo
  output canSeparateClaims content YesNo

scope Article172JoinderSeparation:
  label join_default definition canJoinClaims equals No

  label join_related exception join_default
  definition canJoinClaims under condition
    claimsRelated = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label separate_default definition canSeparateClaims equals No

  label separate_appropriate exception separate_default
  definition canSeparateClaims under condition
    separateConsiderationMoreAppropriate = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```
